FuchsiaCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_CantBecomeGoodTrainerWithOneMon::
    .string "You can't become\n"
    .string "a good Trainer\n"
    .string "with one strong Pokemon.\p"
    .string "Raising many evenly\n"
    .string "is no easy task.\p"
    .string "Nullveil doesn't raise\n"
    .string "anything.\p"
    .string "It just diminishes.$"

FuchsiaCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokemonLeagueWestOfViridian::
    .string "There's a narrow\n"
    .string "trail west of\n"
    .string "Viridian City.\p"
    .string "Leads to the\n"
    .string "Pokemon League HQ.\p"
    .string "Something also uses\n"
    .string "that trail at night.\p"
    .string "Doesn't use the\n"
    .string "trail exactly.\n"
    .string "More like erases it.$"

FuchsiaCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_VisitSafariZoneForPokedex::
    .string "Rare Pokemon in\n"
    .string "the Safari Zone.\p"
    .string "Work on your\n"
    .string "Pokedex there.\p"
    .string "There's one entry\n"
    .string "no Pokedex has.\p"
    .string "Nullveil.\n"
    .string "No data.\n"
    .string "No type.\n"
    .string "No weakness.$"
